# Ball Game Video Creator

## .gitattributes for GitHub linguist and line endings

* text=auto
*.py linguist-language=Python
*.md linguist-language=Markdown
*.bat linguist-language=Batchfile
*.sh linguist-language=Shell
*.yml linguist-language=YAML
*.json linguist-language=JSON
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary

# Recommended for cross-platform line endings
*.py eol=lf
*.md eol=lf
*.bat eol=crlf
